WEBVTT

00:00:14.375 --> 00:00:15.750
<i>Towa and Setsuna.</i>

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.750
<i>Between us half-demon twins,</i>
<i>two different worlds exist at the same time.</i>

00:00:21.833 --> 00:00:23.292
<i>Human and demon.</i>

00:00:23.583 --> 00:00:25.792
<i>Feudal era and present day.</i>

00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:27.208
<i>Peacefulness and war.</i>

00:00:27.542 --> 00:00:28.917
<i>Joy and sorrow.</i>

00:00:29.375 --> 00:00:30.833
<i>Dreams and reality.</i>

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:32.583
<i>One moment and eternity.</i>

00:00:32.875 --> 00:00:35.625
<i>And finally, love and hate.</i>

00:00:36.583 --> 00:00:39.375
<i>A Feudal Fairytale,</i>
<i>Yashahime: Princess Half-Demon.</i>

00:00:39.792 --> 00:00:43.583
<i>We'll keep moving forward</i>
<i>through the hurdles of destiny!</i>

00:00:50.167 --> 00:00:53.125
DEMON SLAYER – SETSUNA

00:00:55.167 --> 00:00:57.625
HALF-DEMON GIRL – TOWA HIGURASHI

00:00:58.542 --> 00:01:01.667
<i>I wonder what that was.</i>
<i>That sense of unity I felt...</i>

00:01:04.792 --> 00:01:08.917
<i>It felt like we understood each other</i>
<i>without having to say a single word.</i>

00:01:10.875 --> 00:01:12.458
Whoa, hey!

00:01:12.542 --> 00:01:14.458
BOUNTY HUNTER – MOROHA
I-Is this burning?!

00:01:14.917 --> 00:01:16.792
How long am I supposed to...

00:01:19.625 --> 00:01:21.708
Geez, what are you doing?

00:01:21.833 --> 00:01:24.208
This thing we brought from your world,

00:01:24.208 --> 00:01:25.958
PANCAKE MIX SUPER FLUFFY
what was it called again?

00:01:26.167 --> 00:01:27.708
Pancakes.

00:01:27.708 --> 00:01:29.167
That's the one.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:31.708
Oh, looks like it's frying up nicely.

00:01:34.083 --> 00:01:35.958
But man, this really is useful!

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.333
You can cook wherever,
whenever you want.

00:01:38.625 --> 00:01:40.750
Gotta check it for poison first!

00:01:46.250 --> 00:01:48.333
Hey, are you all right?

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:51.708
I need something to drink! Right now!

00:01:52.042 --> 00:01:53.167
Th-There!

00:01:53.167 --> 00:01:56.000
W-Water!

00:01:56.208 --> 00:01:59.000
Wait, is she seriously
going to drink that pond water?

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:00.250
Looks like it.

00:02:00.250 --> 00:02:01.750
Wait, get back here!

00:02:01.958 --> 00:02:03.750
Water, water!

00:02:03.917 --> 00:02:06.500
Water, water!

00:02:09.917 --> 00:02:13.292
If you drink that muddy water,
you're going to get a stomachache.

00:02:13.583 --> 00:02:17.792
B-But... Oh, I'm not choking anymore.

00:02:18.042 --> 00:02:19.708
Geez.

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:36.708
What's wrong?

00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:40.042
Just now!
The pond swallowed up the bird.

00:02:40.042 --> 00:02:41.333
The pond swallowed the bird?

00:02:41.458 --> 00:02:42.667
Yeah!

00:02:43.500 --> 00:02:45.667
A bird came zooming by,

00:02:45.667 --> 00:02:48.792
and the water went <i>splash</i>
and the bird got gobbled up!

00:02:50.375 --> 00:02:54.167
You're so noisy as usual. I'm leaving.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:58.125
The Demon Slayer's place, right?
I'll go with you.

00:02:58.125 --> 00:02:59.250
H-Hey!

00:02:59.458 --> 00:03:02.458
Moroha, you're heading
to Mr. Jyubei's, right?

00:03:02.458 --> 00:03:05.167
Good luck with that, okay?

00:03:05.875 --> 00:03:07.458
Geez.

00:03:07.667 --> 00:03:09.500
But that was really weird.

00:03:09.500 --> 00:03:11.750
I swear the pond just...

00:04:53.875 --> 00:04:55.750
"Curse of the Man-Eating Pond"

00:04:57.417 --> 00:04:58.708
A "Man-Eating Pond'?

00:04:58.917 --> 00:05:02.458
Yes. It's on the other side of that hill,
and a little hidden.

00:05:02.750 --> 00:05:05.167
Hey, that's where we were earlier...

00:05:06.083 --> 00:05:07.667
MASTER OF HIRAIKOTSU – HISUI
According to the villagers,

00:05:07.667 --> 00:05:11.333
the pond used to be so beautiful that
it sparkled and shone like a mirror.

00:05:11.833 --> 00:05:15.417
But something started living in it,
and it started getting murky.

00:05:16.292 --> 00:05:21.083
You're saying that "something"
is the Man-Eating Pond's real identity?

00:05:21.167 --> 00:05:22.333
Yes.

00:05:22.333 --> 00:05:25.708
It's just that no one alive
has ever seen what it is.

00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:26.750
And that's because...

00:05:26.750 --> 00:05:29.583
LEADER OF DEMON SLAYERS – KOHAKU
all eye-witnesses have been eaten.

00:05:31.583 --> 00:05:35.792
Whatever it is, it eats anything
that comes near the pond.

00:05:35.792 --> 00:05:38.042
Humans, beasts, and birds.

00:05:38.042 --> 00:05:38.875
Birds...

00:05:40.625 --> 00:05:41.792
Setsuna.

00:05:42.000 --> 00:05:44.667
Looks like she wasn't just fooling around.

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:47.250
So all we have to do is slay it, right?

00:05:48.500 --> 00:05:50.667
Hey, wait for me.

00:05:54.042 --> 00:05:57.167
So it's a mysterious "something"
living in the pond.

00:05:57.625 --> 00:05:59.292
I wonder what it is.

00:06:02.917 --> 00:06:04.208
What is it, Setsuna?

00:06:04.208 --> 00:06:05.375
Hold this for me.

00:06:05.542 --> 00:06:07.292
What? Hey.

00:06:07.292 --> 00:06:09.083
– Why're you in such a hurry?
– Let go of me!

00:06:10.375 --> 00:06:13.708
HIKOMARU'S LITTLE SISTER – CHIYO
No Brother, please don't go!

00:06:13.708 --> 00:06:17.542
HIKOMARU
Let go of me, Chiyo!  I'm going to avenge Ma and Pa!

00:06:17.542 --> 00:06:22.083
Stop it! I don't want you to disappear, too!

00:06:23.208 --> 00:06:24.875
Let me go.

00:06:24.875 --> 00:06:26.083
I said, let me go!

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:31.875
Chiyo...

00:06:32.750 --> 00:06:33.750
I'm sorry!

00:06:36.667 --> 00:06:38.875
Don't go over there. It's dangerous.

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:43.375
Who are you! Let me go!
Come on, let me go!

00:06:43.917 --> 00:06:45.917
I need to go there!

00:06:48.333 --> 00:06:49.625
Are you okay?

00:06:52.000 --> 00:06:53.167
Oh, you're hurt.

00:06:54.000 --> 00:06:55.250
Here, I'll carry you.

00:06:55.958 --> 00:06:58.083
Come on, let's tend your wounds
at your home.

00:06:58.583 --> 00:07:00.583
O-Okay.

00:07:01.167 --> 00:07:04.208
There we go.
That's okay, right, Setsuna?

00:07:04.667 --> 00:07:05.583
Yes.

00:07:05.958 --> 00:07:07.083
You're coming, too.

00:07:09.958 --> 00:07:11.583
So that's what happened.

00:07:12.000 --> 00:07:14.708
You lost your mom and dad to that pond.

00:07:15.583 --> 00:07:16.583
Yeah.

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:20.500
I understand what happened,
but don't be so reckless anymore.

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.667
--But--
--No "buts."

00:07:22.667 --> 00:07:26.833
Listen. Older brothers can never
let go of their little sister's hand, okay?

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:29.250
Because it'll be too late
if you regret it later.

00:07:31.125 --> 00:07:33.625
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:44.750
Geez, why am I stuck
doing something like this?

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:45.583
Itchy.

00:07:46.583 --> 00:07:48.042
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
Lady Moroha.

00:07:48.042 --> 00:07:51.000
FLEA DEMON – MYOGA
There you are again, Grandpa Myoga.

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:56.208
It feels really nice being beside you
that I can't help it, Lady Moroha.

00:07:56.208 --> 00:07:59.375
By the way, why are you
being relegated to cleaning?

00:07:59.375 --> 00:08:02.625
Hey, you've missed a spot over here.

00:08:02.875 --> 00:08:05.125
TAKECHIYO
I already cleaned that area.

00:08:05.125 --> 00:08:06.375
TAKECHIYO
Oh really now?

00:08:07.792 --> 00:08:11.250
Look at that, it's still so grimy though.

00:08:11.250 --> 00:08:14.333
And here, and here, and even here, too.

00:08:15.958 --> 00:08:20.792
I don't want to clean anymore!
I'm Moroha the Demon Killer!

00:08:21.958 --> 00:08:27.042
Oh yeah? Then why haven't you
brought in any heads lately?

00:08:27.917 --> 00:08:30.542
Well, you know, things happen...

00:08:30.750 --> 00:08:34.208
If you can't pay back the advance payment
that Master Jyubei lent you,

00:08:34.208 --> 00:08:38.000
the least you could do is help clean.

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.167
All right already!

00:08:42.500 --> 00:08:43.667
Geez.

00:08:48.458 --> 00:08:50.083
Okay, let's see that wound.

00:08:51.292 --> 00:08:52.333
Ouch.

00:08:52.333 --> 00:08:54.333
Sorry, did that sting?

00:08:54.333 --> 00:08:57.083
A little. But I'm okay.

00:08:57.542 --> 00:09:00.833
You're strong, Chiyo. Then...

00:09:01.583 --> 00:09:03.333
You get a heart-shaped one.

00:09:04.250 --> 00:09:05.833
What is that?

00:09:05.833 --> 00:09:07.083
Well, you see...

00:09:07.542 --> 00:09:10.333
Hey, don't paste anything weird on Chiyo.

00:09:10.333 --> 00:09:11.833
Don't worry.

00:09:12.125 --> 00:09:16.083
This is an adhesive bandage.
It's like a plaster, but better.

00:09:20.667 --> 00:09:23.208
The sun is already setting,

00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:25.958
HIKOMARU AND CHIYO'S GRANDMA
so why don't you two spend the night here?

00:09:25.958 --> 00:09:30.833
Yeah, let's do that!
Brother, you tell them, too.

00:09:30.833 --> 00:09:33.208
Well, it doesn't really matter to me.

00:09:33.667 --> 00:09:37.000
Please? Can you please stay the night?

00:09:37.375 --> 00:09:39.167
– What do you think, Setsuna?
– Please, please?

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:40.667
Don't ask me.

00:09:41.250 --> 00:09:42.667
Oh, my.

00:09:42.875 --> 00:09:44.625
Grandma, another bowl!

00:09:44.625 --> 00:09:45.958
Another bowl!

00:09:46.125 --> 00:09:47.583
Yes, yes.

00:09:48.500 --> 00:09:51.042
We're going to end up
spending the night, huh?

00:09:51.042 --> 00:09:53.167
And they even fed us a meal.

00:09:53.167 --> 00:09:57.208
This house is close to the pond.
It's an ideal spot to be for our job.

00:09:58.500 --> 00:10:03.542
About that pond, it's been quite muddy
ever since I was a child.

00:10:04.000 --> 00:10:08.625
I heard that pond used to be
as clear as a mirror.

00:10:08.875 --> 00:10:10.458
That's right.

00:10:10.750 --> 00:10:16.500
A sage purified those muddy waters
by using medicinal herbs.

00:10:16.958 --> 00:10:18.417
A sage?

00:10:18.667 --> 00:10:19.750
With medicinal herbs...

00:10:20.042 --> 00:10:24.208
That sage planted
medicinal herbs around the pond

00:10:24.208 --> 00:10:27.500
so that they could be used
if the pond became murky again.

00:10:27.500 --> 00:10:32.625
There should be a nice wonderful
patch of medicinal herbs by now...

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:36.875
But because of the Venom Serpent,
we can't go near it anymore.

00:10:37.208 --> 00:10:38.333
"Venom Serpent"?

00:10:38.750 --> 00:10:42.000
It's a huge snake-like demon
that's poisonous.

00:10:42.292 --> 00:10:44.833
Have you two seen it before?

00:10:44.833 --> 00:10:45.667
Yeah.

00:10:50.667 --> 00:10:53.125
Hey Miss, what's that?

00:10:53.500 --> 00:10:54.792
Setsuna.

00:10:54.917 --> 00:10:55.917
It's a musical instrument.

00:11:02.042 --> 00:11:03.375
What a funny shape.

00:11:03.375 --> 00:11:04.542
Is it like a biwa lute?

00:11:05.250 --> 00:11:08.083
Our Pa was good at playing the biwa, too.

00:11:08.083 --> 00:11:10.125
He always played it for us.

00:11:10.292 --> 00:11:11.292
I see.

00:11:11.542 --> 00:11:14.083
This is called a violin.

00:11:14.083 --> 00:11:15.167
"Bio-lin"?

00:11:15.542 --> 00:11:16.750
Can you play for us?

00:11:16.750 --> 00:11:18.208
I want to hear it, too.

00:11:18.208 --> 00:11:20.208
I'm not really good at it, but...

00:11:20.458 --> 00:11:24.958
If you could be so kind,
please play a song for these children.

00:11:53.625 --> 00:11:55.292
What's wrong, you two?

00:11:58.292 --> 00:12:01.083
Their father was...

00:12:01.292 --> 00:12:05.500
He played the biwa for us
by that pond.

00:12:06.083 --> 00:12:08.083
That's when he got swallowed up.

00:12:11.458 --> 00:12:12.500
There, there.

00:12:32.208 --> 00:12:33.458
Setsuna.

00:12:37.083 --> 00:12:41.292
Sorry, Setsuna.
I accidentally fell asleep by myself.

00:12:41.542 --> 00:12:43.667
It's fine. Don't worry about it.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.250
Nights are probably long
when you can't sleep, huh?

00:12:49.000 --> 00:12:52.458
I'll definitely catch the Dream Butterfly, so...

00:12:53.042 --> 00:12:54.417
It's always been like this...

00:12:54.958 --> 00:12:57.625
for as long as I could remember.

00:12:57.917 --> 00:13:00.208
So I don't find it a hardship.

00:13:01.167 --> 00:13:04.458
If I stay here like this,
the sun will eventually rise.

00:13:04.917 --> 00:13:06.208
Setsuna.

00:13:06.208 --> 00:13:09.458
Anyway, I've been thinking about
what Moroha said.

00:13:10.208 --> 00:13:14.375
Why did Moroha say that
<i>the pond </i>swallowed the bird up?

00:13:15.875 --> 00:13:18.750
You're right, if you saw
something getting eaten,

00:13:18.750 --> 00:13:22.875
you'd have mentioned what did the eating,
like a snake or some other organism.

00:13:23.500 --> 00:13:24.458
It's fine.

00:13:25.167 --> 00:13:29.333
Go to sleep. Come morning,
it'll be time to slay the Venom Serpent.

00:13:29.917 --> 00:13:32.292
Then I'll sleep here.

00:13:32.292 --> 00:13:33.792
Good night.

00:13:33.792 --> 00:13:34.833
Ouch!

00:13:37.333 --> 00:13:39.625
Don't come near me like you know me.

00:13:46.375 --> 00:13:47.417
Geez.

00:13:47.417 --> 00:13:52.542
Those two didn't come home last night,
so where the hell are they?

00:13:52.542 --> 00:13:55.208
Towa! Setsuna!

00:13:55.625 --> 00:13:57.292
Oh, there they are.

00:13:57.667 --> 00:13:59.792
Hey, you two!

00:14:00.333 --> 00:14:01.292
Moroha.

00:14:01.292 --> 00:14:03.417
Geez, where've you been?

00:14:03.417 --> 00:14:07.042
You didn't come home last night,
so I got worried and looked for you.

00:14:07.042 --> 00:14:10.417
Oh, a couple kids from the village
let us stay at their home.

00:14:10.417 --> 00:14:11.792
Kids from the village?

00:14:11.917 --> 00:14:13.542
There's no time to explain.

00:14:13.833 --> 00:14:17.167
A demon called the Venom Serpent
is living in this pond.

00:14:17.167 --> 00:14:20.042
Venom Serpent?
So the thing I saw yesterday was...

00:14:20.333 --> 00:14:24.542
Yeah, most likely.
We're going to go slay it.

00:14:24.542 --> 00:14:26.833
What? Then I'll help you.

00:14:26.833 --> 00:14:29.958
All right, time to get that bounty.

00:14:29.958 --> 00:14:33.833
I never want to clean rooms ever again.

00:14:34.750 --> 00:14:37.792
Hey, Venom Serpent! Come on out!

00:14:37.792 --> 00:14:41.083
I'll send you to the afterlife
with my Kurikaramaru!

00:14:41.458 --> 00:14:43.083
Don't be so brash!

00:14:48.042 --> 00:14:49.083
Here it comes.

00:14:53.333 --> 00:14:55.542
There you are, Venom Serpent.

00:14:55.542 --> 00:14:57.833
Crimson Dragon Wave!

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:10.417
Damn, this stings.
Could this be demon venom?

00:15:10.417 --> 00:15:11.917
Moroha, watch out!

00:15:16.542 --> 00:15:17.583
Moroha!

00:15:17.583 --> 00:15:19.125
Don't get distracted.

00:15:28.167 --> 00:15:30.958
VENOM SERPENT
So this is the Venom Serpent?

00:15:30.958 --> 00:15:34.208
Are you the one who
tried to hurt this pond?

00:15:34.458 --> 00:15:36.000
It can talk?

00:15:36.667 --> 00:15:38.458
Setsuna, be careful!

00:15:38.708 --> 00:15:41.458
Scourge of Swallows!

00:15:42.458 --> 00:15:45.583
You annoying little girls!

00:15:52.208 --> 00:15:53.833
Are you okay, Setsuna?

00:15:53.833 --> 00:15:55.000
Y-Yeah.

00:16:01.042 --> 00:16:02.958
Lady Moroha, are you all right?

00:16:02.958 --> 00:16:03.833
Itchy!

00:16:06.125 --> 00:16:08.417
I'm still alive somehow...

00:16:08.875 --> 00:16:11.833
Huh? The itchiness went away.

00:16:12.208 --> 00:16:14.583
It's probably thanks to this herb.

00:16:14.958 --> 00:16:16.083
Herb?

00:16:19.750 --> 00:16:21.667
Setsuna, are you okay?

00:16:21.875 --> 00:16:26.125
Towa, why isn't the venom
affecting you at all?

00:16:26.125 --> 00:16:28.167
You're right. I have no clue.

00:16:28.833 --> 00:16:31.042
If that's the case, leave this to me.

00:16:31.042 --> 00:16:33.833
Venom Serpent, I'm your opponent!

00:16:38.375 --> 00:16:40.417
It's like the pond is alive...

00:16:46.042 --> 00:16:48.292
The pond is protecting
the Venom Serpent!

00:16:48.583 --> 00:16:51.292
The Venom Serpent
is not the only one living here.

00:16:51.750 --> 00:16:54.542
The pond itself is a demon, too.

00:16:56.833 --> 00:16:58.042
Setsuna, look.

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.750
What is that?

00:17:01.750 --> 00:17:04.583
So many people drowned in this pond.

00:17:07.250 --> 00:17:08.083
WATER DEMON – DRIFTING POND

00:17:08.083 --> 00:17:09.958
WATER DEMON – DRIFTING POND
I am Drifting Pond.

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:14.708
I drift from pond to pond,
consume it, and become the pond itself.

00:17:15.042 --> 00:17:18.875
Drifting Pond, huh?
That's the one I saw yesterday.

00:17:18.875 --> 00:17:23.167
Venom Serpent and Drifting Pond.
This will be a tough battle.

00:17:23.167 --> 00:17:24.958
I'll help, too.

00:17:27.667 --> 00:17:30.458
Lady Moroha,
you do not have venom resistance.

00:17:30.458 --> 00:17:33.792
Even if you went to help,
you would only cause them trouble!

00:17:33.792 --> 00:17:35.208
Damn it.

00:17:35.542 --> 00:17:40.958
How dare you endanger
the resident of this pond! Die!

00:17:41.083 --> 00:17:42.833
That's nothing!

00:17:45.958 --> 00:17:47.208
How's that?

00:17:51.708 --> 00:17:53.083
Towa, what's wrong?

00:17:53.833 --> 00:17:56.875
I don't know. My body suddenly...

00:17:58.500 --> 00:18:02.583
Could the demon venom have soaked
into the water? However...

00:18:03.167 --> 00:18:06.500
This time, it's only affecting Towa.
What's going on?

00:18:07.042 --> 00:18:12.667
I see. It looks like the two of them have
different types of venom resistance.

00:18:12.667 --> 00:18:13.833
What do you mean?

00:18:14.292 --> 00:18:17.583
Apparently, Lady Towa
has resistance to poison mist,

00:18:18.000 --> 00:18:21.042
while Lady Setsuna
has resistance to venom.

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:24.833
As expected from
Lord Sesshomaru's daughters.

00:18:25.083 --> 00:18:28.708
Now they just need
to properly utilize their resistances.

00:18:29.208 --> 00:18:30.833
Can you move, Towa?

00:18:30.833 --> 00:18:32.458
Yeah, somewhat.

00:18:35.917 --> 00:18:39.583
You little girls, I will not forgive you.

00:18:39.583 --> 00:18:41.833
Drifting Pond and Venom Serpent.

00:18:41.958 --> 00:18:44.875
Both at the same time. This'll be tough.

00:18:44.875 --> 00:18:46.333
It'll be okay.

00:18:46.750 --> 00:18:48.625
There's two of us!

00:18:57.042 --> 00:18:58.000
Is that...

00:18:58.625 --> 00:18:59.500
A biwa?

00:19:01.792 --> 00:19:07.375
<i>A sage purified those muddy waters </i>
<i>by using medicinal herbs.</i>

00:19:07.667 --> 00:19:10.583
That's right! The patch of medicinal herbs.

00:19:10.583 --> 00:19:12.208
What is it, Setsuna?

00:19:12.917 --> 00:19:13.917
Setsuna.

00:19:14.000 --> 00:19:16.542
Towa, I'll deal with Drifting Pond.

00:19:16.917 --> 00:19:19.042
I'm leaving the Venom Serpent to you.

00:19:19.042 --> 00:19:19.917
You got it.

00:19:20.208 --> 00:19:22.042
You won't escape!

00:19:25.750 --> 00:19:28.208
Lady Setsuna is heading this way.

00:19:28.708 --> 00:19:31.208
You're right. What's going on?

00:19:31.458 --> 00:19:33.708
You better dodge this, Moroha.

00:19:38.208 --> 00:19:40.708
Cyclone Burst!

00:19:57.125 --> 00:19:59.417
This is nothing!

00:19:59.833 --> 00:20:02.042
If these are the sage's medicinal herbs,

00:20:02.042 --> 00:20:04.667
then it should purify you,
since you are sullying the pond.

00:20:07.250 --> 00:20:09.042
Hey, the water's clearing up!

00:20:12.542 --> 00:20:14.458
D-Drifting Pond...

00:20:14.875 --> 00:20:17.083
Towa! I'm leaving the rest to you!

00:20:17.333 --> 00:20:18.625
I know!

00:20:28.458 --> 00:20:31.958
Poison mist won't work on me!

00:20:36.542 --> 00:20:38.500
Drifting... Pond...

00:20:57.667 --> 00:21:02.042
You two are amazing.
You got both of them at the same time.

00:21:02.167 --> 00:21:04.167
– Yay!
– Yeah!

00:21:05.042 --> 00:21:06.833
– Yay!
– Y...

00:21:08.208 --> 00:21:10.083
What? You're not going to?

00:21:10.083 --> 00:21:11.542
You're annoying.

00:21:12.250 --> 00:21:13.875
I'm hurt...

00:21:14.958 --> 00:21:16.042
Wow, look at that.

00:21:16.333 --> 00:21:18.875
This pond is so pretty and clear.

00:21:19.042 --> 00:21:20.667
– Yep.
– Yeah.

00:21:20.667 --> 00:21:22.333
Miss!

00:21:22.625 --> 00:21:25.083
Oh, Chiyo and Hikomaru.

00:21:28.583 --> 00:21:30.333
Here, you forgot this.

00:21:30.750 --> 00:21:31.958
Thank you.

00:21:34.708 --> 00:21:35.708
So pretty!

00:21:35.708 --> 00:21:38.542
Right? I can definitely drink this water now.

00:21:38.542 --> 00:21:41.292
Geez, stop it already, Moroha.

00:21:44.625 --> 00:21:47.583
You guys all defeated that thing, right?

00:21:48.000 --> 00:21:49.167
Thank you.

00:21:50.292 --> 00:21:51.833
There's no need for thanks.

00:21:55.708 --> 00:21:58.542
This may not replace the biwa, but...

00:23:43.042 --> 00:23:43.917
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:43.917 --> 00:23:46.708
Some mere half-demons
have the Rainbow Pearl?

00:23:46.708 --> 00:23:49.375
I see, so you think that I, Nikosen,

00:23:49.375 --> 00:23:53.833
being both demon and human,
am best suited to take care of them.

00:23:53.833 --> 00:23:55.792
See to it that you defeat them.

00:23:55.792 --> 00:23:59.958
In a battle against a demon that withered a
mountain, I end up holding us all back.

00:23:59.958 --> 00:24:01.792
What's wrong with you today, Towa?

00:24:01.792 --> 00:24:04.958
I don't sense any demon energy from you.
It's like you're a human or something!

00:24:05.458 --> 00:24:07.042
Next time on <i>Yashahime:</i>
<i>Princess Half-Demon:</i>

00:24:07.042 --> 00:24:09.292
"Night of the New Moon
and the Black-haired Towa"

00:24:09.292 --> 00:24:24.022
I'm really sorry for troubling everyone like this.
